        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "380d095d-0590-319e-b3a2-1bdbb83f90a0",
                "word": "AGI",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "496dc741-686c-3dea-9d58-ec73a7ca45f9",
                        "entry_id": "380d095d-0590-319e-b3a2-1bdbb83f90a0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Intelligence artificielle générale : intelligence artificielle capable d’effectuer ou d’apprendre pratiquement n’importe quelle tâche cognitive propre aux humains ou autres animaux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Intelligence artificielle"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b7ae34b-20cd-4f26-9678-04c881594ec8",
                                "sense_id": "496dc741-686c-3dea-9d58-ec73a7ca45f9",
                                "text": "Pourtant, ChatGPT n’est pas vraiment une « intelligence », comme nous l’expliquait Christophe Cerisara, chercheur du CNRS : « Il n’y a pas de définition exacte d’une intelligence artificielle générale (AGI) parce qu'il y a différentes interprétations. C’est une intelligence artificielle qui aurait les mêmes facultés cognitives que l’humain. Elle serait capable d’apprendre par elle-même et de s’améliorer avec le temps. C’est de la science-fiction, soyons clair. ChatGPT ne possède en rien toutes les capacités cognitives humaines. »"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "243fa746-1dc9-4207-9158-2438507701de",
                        "source_entry_id": "380d095d-0590-319e-b3a2-1bdbb83f90a0",
                        "source_sense_id": "496dc741-686c-3dea-9d58-ec73a7ca45f9",
                        "target_lang_word": "AGI",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "AGI",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f43548b-ae83-3992-91c4-9b5affd1d628",
                                        "entry_id": "a6efa957-ccff-3a9d-be89-f40bb890ac53",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of artificial general intelligence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "initialism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5899a33a-e68a-44e4-b9dc-96769894d47b",
                                                "sense_id": "4f43548b-ae83-3992-91c4-9b5affd1d628",
                                                "text": "AGIs will indeed be capable of self-awareness – but that is because they will be General: they will be capable of awareness of every kind of deep and subtle thing, including their own selves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0109afa7-80b6-4f91-873d-e01d180dbcbd",
                                                "sense_id": "4f43548b-ae83-3992-91c4-9b5affd1d628",
                                                "text": "If AI researchers do eventually manage to make the leap to AGI, there is little reason to believe that the result will be a machine that simply matches human-level intelligence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ded2043e-4e4e-45b1-bf09-8472739402c7",
                                                "sense_id": "4f43548b-ae83-3992-91c4-9b5affd1d628",
                                                "text": "In the beginning, this level of secrecy was never the intention, but it has since become habitual. Over time, the leadership has moved away from its original belief that openness is the best way to build beneficial AGI."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c22a213-791e-4eed-9099-7a30be7bf9bb",
                                                "sense_id": "4f43548b-ae83-3992-91c4-9b5affd1d628",
                                                "text": "Some of my friends have recently reported to me that when people outside the AI industry hear about extinction risk from Artificial General Intelligence for the first time, their reaction is “maybe we should not build AGI, then.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "431d6761-c691-4a7d-95e0-bb722c8412a2",
                                                "sense_id": "4f43548b-ae83-3992-91c4-9b5affd1d628",
                                                "text": "Some experts believe that truly transformative implications, including artificial general intelligence (AGI) enabling AI to perform essentially all human tasks, could be around the corner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b248efc-86b5-427d-b425-2b726237dc57",
                                                "sense_id": "4f43548b-ae83-3992-91c4-9b5affd1d628",
                                                "text": "Yet the narrative that A.G.I. is just around the corner and will usher in “massive prosperity,” as Mr. Altman has written, is already leading companies to accrue large amounts of capital, lay claim to data and electricity and build enormous data centers that are accelerating the climate crisis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13f892a8-4d45-4268-a0bb-6b07175f01bd",
                                                "sense_id": "4f43548b-ae83-3992-91c4-9b5affd1d628",
                                                "text": "GPT-5 is a major upgrade over GPT-4 and a significant step along our path to AGI."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2209929b-c8b4-3cfb-8661-35033282fc2c",
                                        "entry_id": "a6efa957-ccff-3a9d-be89-f40bb890ac53",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of adjusted gross income."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "initialism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01764689-48da-49b3-bed8-1127ea6cab7b",
                                                "sense_id": "2209929b-c8b4-3cfb-8661-35033282fc2c",
                                                "text": "The credit begins to phase out for adjusted gross incomes (AGIs) over $252,150 and completely phases out at AGIs over $292,150. Both the credit and AGI limits are indexed for inflation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07e3d8dd-c3eb-3e28-a860-71b254c3ec94",
                                        "entry_id": "a6efa957-ccff-3a9d-be89-f40bb890ac53",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of agility point."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
